# The template of a claim (hard_claims/wrong_value, conjecture_proved,
# template_body and cycle_claim, the cycle claims of certificate_cycles and
# easy_terms, adder_tautologies/adder_point): a Scott sum of three
# constructors, in order: boolean, whose one field is a Church Boolean of
# corpora/library/prelude/boolean; natural, whose one field is the count;
# member, whose two fields are the index and the certificate's name. Read by
# its position (gezi.contest.corpora.claims.Template).
λ export
. export
  (λvalue boolean natural member. boolean value)
  (λcount boolean natural member. natural count) λindex certificate boolean natural member. member index certificate
